I put on a light jacket.
I go outside from the house.
The morning air is cool and damp.
The streets are wet today.
Everywhere there is the sweet smell of wet earth.
This is the first rain in Mumbai.
Usually, I like this smell.
My pace is slow.
There is an ache in my whole body.
There is pain in my legs too.
Therefore, I walk slowly towards the clinic.
The clinic is right near my building.
I do not need a rickshaw.
But today every step is difficult.
The cool wind touches my face.
I shiver due to the cold.
Now I only want to rest.
Finally, I see the clinic's door.
I open the door and enter inside.
